 Cooperative Washishti in Chiplun (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3398,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/police-judiciary/khed-police-station1-dd038f52.jpg','Khed Police Station[1]','Khed Police Station[1]',NULL),(3421,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/map-showing-ancient-trade_t3TYRw5.png','Map showing ancient trade centres mentioned in thePeriplus of the Erythraean Sea(1st century CE), a Greco-Roman text describing maritime commerce in the Indian Ocean. The western coast of India is dotted with ports such as Barygaza (Bharuch), Suppara (Nala Sopara), Tagara (Ter), and Palaepatmai — the latter identified by some scholars with Palshet in present-day Ratnagiri district. This highlights Ratnagiri’s location within broader early trade circuits[1]','Map showing ancient trade centres mentioned in thePeriplus of the Erythraean Sea(1st century CE), a Greco-Roman text describing maritime commerce in the Indian Ocean. The western coast of India is dotted with ports such as Barygaza (Bharuch), Suppara (Nala Sopara), Tagara (Ter), and Palaepatmai — the latter identified by some scholars with Palshet in present-day Ratnagiri district. This highlights Ratnagiri’s location within broader early trade circuits[1]',NULL),(3423,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/map-of-key-ports-and-sett_Y8Ica81.png','Map of key ports and settlements in the Indian Ocean trade network during the 1st millennium BCE. Dabhol, on the Konkan coast in present-day Ratnagiri district, was one of several active ports noted that connected western India to Arabia, Persia, and East Africa. (Source: South Asian Studies)[2]','Map of key ports and settlements in the Indian Ocean trade network during the 1st millennium BCE. Dabhol, on the Konkan coast in present-day Ratnagiri district, was one of several active ports noted that connected western India to Arabia, Persia, and East Africa. (Source: South Asian Studies)[2]',NULL),(3428,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/an-archival-image-of-a-ve_wIip9Nw.png','An archival image of a vessel from the British India Steam Navigation Company, whose steamships were known to operate along the Konkan coast, including ports in Ratnagiri district.[3]','An archival image of a vessel from the British India Steam Navigation Company, whose steamships were known to operate along the Konkan coast, including ports in Ratnagiri district.[3]',NULL),(3432,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/a-renovated-railway-stati_bcjrh7G.jpg','A renovated Railway station at Chiplun, Ratnagiri. (Source: CKA Archives)','A renovated Railway station at Chiplun, Ratnagiri. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3435,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/lal-pari-bus-halting-to-p_BJDZuPk.jpg','Lal Pari bus halting to pick up passengers along a highway in Ratnagiri district.These iconic red MSRTC buses have long served as a lifeline for inter-village and inter-district travel. (Source: CKA Archives)','Lal Pari bus halting to pick up passengers along a highway in Ratnagiri district.These iconic red MSRTC buses have long served as a lifeline for inter-village and inter-district travel. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3437,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/a-shivshahi-air-condition_ckdC67K.jpg','A Shivshahi air-conditioned bus at Ratnagiri bus stand.Part of MSRTC’s premium fleet, Shivshahi buses offer comfortable travel on longer intercity routes. (Source: CKA Archives)','A Shivshahi air-conditioned bus at Ratnagiri bus stand.Part of MSRTC’s premium fleet, Shivshahi buses offer comfortable travel on longer intercity routes. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3441,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/a-colorful-auto-in-lote-k_Lo4w2uL.jpg','A colorful auto in Lote, Khed taluka, Ratnagiri district. (Source: CKA Archives)','A colorful auto in Lote, Khed taluka, Ratnagiri district. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3449,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/front-page-of-the-ratnagi_HhrziEb.jpg','Front page of the Ratnagiri Times, a prominent Marathi-language daily widely read across Ratnagiri district for its coverage of local and regional news. (Source: CKA Archives)','Front page of the Ratnagiri Times, a prominent Marathi-language daily widely read across Ratnagiri district for its coverage of local and regional news. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3457,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/signboard-of-the-ratnagir_3CIQcpF.jpg','Signboard of the Ratnagiri Head Post Office, one of the main postal service centers in the district, continues to serve both urban and rural populations. (Source: CKA Archives)','Signboard of the Ratnagiri Head Post Office, one of the main postal service centers in the district, continues to serve both urban and rural populations. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3459,'statistic/images/maharashtra/ratnagiri/transport-communication/a-local-branch-of-india-p_S4tZNih.jpg','A local branch of India Post in Chirani village, Ratnagiri district. (Source: CKA Archives)','A local branch of India Post in Chirani village, Ratnagiri district. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3489,'statistic/images/maharashtra/akola/agriculture/a-cotton-bud-is-ready-for-harvest-source-_azMlnh4.jpg','A cotton bud is ready for harvest. (Source: CKA Archives)','A cotton bud is ready for harvest. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3496,'statistic/images/maharashtra/akola/agriculture/hurda-being-roasted1-f5db5365.jpg','Hurda being roasted[1]','Hurda being roasted[1]',NULL),(3497,'statistic/images/maharashtra/akola/agriculture/kneaded-jowar-dough-source-cka-archives-dbeac764.jpg','Kneaded Jowar Dough. (Source: CKA Archives)','Kneaded Jowar Dough. (Source: CKA Archives)',NULL),(3500,'statistic/images/maharashtra/akola/agriculture/a-mot-used-by-farmers-for-irrigation-sour_TKEOo9p.jpg','A mot, used by farmers for irrigation.